 Mortal who's developed a Code to become more resilient to the supernatural horrors they intentionally go out to find</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, Hunter are technically Mortal, but they have their own gameline, so, if I want to talk about thr advantage of Hunter I would go there instead.<br /> <br /> Mortal are also one of the most malleable creature in CofD, they can turn into 10 splat (inculding Hunter), so they got that going for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-24T05:59:55-08:00","id":1531421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1531275-the-advantage-of-being-mortal?p=1531418#post1531418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mortal are also one of the most malleable creature in CofD, they can turn into 10 splat (inculding Hunter), so they got that going for them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eight, possibly nine if you count the ability to be subsumed into a reincarnating mummy or turned into one through circumstances that can no longer be replicated. Demons were never human and &quot;turning a mortal into a Promethean&quot; means killing them and using their body as raw materials for a different person.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet m